{"id": "68866", "title": "“战”为己有", "author": "锁然无骨", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68866.htm", "intro": "一枚男人， \r\n上得厅堂下得厨房，闲暇时光还能暖床。 \r\n他可以前一秒衣冠整齐滴羞涩：“君子止于礼，小人动手脚。” \r\n却突然下一秒衣衫尽褪滴飞眼：“君子坦蛋蛋，小人藏JJ。” \r\n这枚男人，明骚毕露，暗贱也不知道藏一藏—— \r\n战战抱头：TO收OR NOT TO收，THAT IS A QUESTION。 \r\n\r\n内容标签： 情有独钟 高干", "base": "files/article/html/68/68866", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "10549626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-12", "file": "10549627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-18", "file": "10549628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-25", "file": "10549629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "10549630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-37", "file": "10549631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-42", "file": "10549632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-49", "file": "10549633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "50-55完结", "file": "10549634.html", "available": false}]}